<title>SWEDEN: Moody's confirms Kemira Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Moody's confirms Kemira Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's credit rating agency said it confirmed the Baa1 rating on the guaranteed Eurobond of Finnish chemical company Kemira Oy and the company's Prime-2 commercial paper rating following the announcement that the Finnish government plans to reduce its holding from 72.3 to about 55 percent.  </p>
<p>Moody's said it noted current ratings continue to give weight to the onwership of the Finnish government, whose sovereigh rating is Aa2.</p>
<p>Moody's said it recognised substantial improvements in Kemira's operating performance and capital structure but added that Kemira's current financial profile is not supportive of the assigned rating categories.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
